Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.05,0:00:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.15,0:00:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.55,0:01:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, then, we have some\Ncatching up to do, haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.23,0:01:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But we destroyed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.69,0:01:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He regenerated himself. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.73,0:01:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone couldn't handle the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So I needed to step in and correct\Nthat. I just needed... Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.17,0:01:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You just needed a little\Nmore time, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.91,0:01:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.81,0:01:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, close to being defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.01,0:01:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you let me focus on the Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.45,0:01:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You have other things to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.95,0:01:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,like convincing that son of yours to pledge\Nhis allegiance to Zork, the Dark One.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.09,0:01:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't listen to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.93,0:01:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You belong with us, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.15,0:01:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,When the Age of Shadows is ushered in,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.87,0:01:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,a new king will be needed\Nto rule the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.01,0:01:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone who possesses a great power.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.45,0:01:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.87,0:01:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There is he.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.57,0:02:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, are you out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.43,0:02:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You have been chosen to wield a power that\Nrivals that of the Egyptian God, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.21,0:02:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.12,0:02:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.53,0:02:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like his majesty\Nis feeling threatened by
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.27,0:02:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,the idea of being replaced\Nby someone more qualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.93,0:02:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone who controls the\NBlue Eyes, White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.05,0:02:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Kisara. He needs that young\Ngirl. You knew about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.19,0:02:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Recently, Seto and I\Nhappened upon a peasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.59,0:02:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,girl She held a power\Nlike none I have ever seen
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.89,0:02:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Seto Wait, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.15,0:02:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The power within her. It's too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.37,0:02:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever this girl is She\Npossesses a powerful gift
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.73,0:02:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps a powerful curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.15,0:03:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, this force mustn't\Nfall into the wrong hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.93,0:03:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Or else what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.21,0:03:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You might lose your control\Nover the Egyptian people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.71,0:03:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.65,0:03:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact remains that Zork is\Nabout to resurrect at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.77,0:03:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and there's nothing any\Nof you can do to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.53,0:03:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see if Seto is intelligent\Nenough to take his father's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.87,0:03:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,advice and join the winning\Nside before the game is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.97,0:03:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.27,0:03:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If you side with the Pharaoh,\Nyou'll be throwing away your future!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.03,0:03:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.01,0:03:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You were born to be a\Nleader! You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.53,0:03:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do this, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.81,0:03:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.83,0:03:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You have bigger things to worry about now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.37,0:03:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Diabound, strike down the Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.45,0:03:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He's returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.87,0:03:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.87,0:03:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dark stone tablet has\Nalready been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.13,0:03:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You underestimate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.81,0:03:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I have all the Millennium Items,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.13,0:04:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I no longer need a tablet\Nto summon Diabound.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.37,0:04:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And with the power of these\Ntreasures coursing through its veins,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.01,0:04:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,my Diabound is stronger than ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.17,0:04:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Look into my eye and see your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.37,0:04:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall be king.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.43,0:04:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.75,0:04:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You know you belong with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.87,0:04:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.99,0:04:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, you're a member of the seven\Nsacred guardians of the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.49,0:04:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember the vow that you took?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.65,0:04:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If you accept the dark\Npower of the Shadows,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.61,0:04:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be making the same\Nmistake that your father made.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.51,0:04:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.19,0:04:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're controlling you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.23,0:04:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of your meddling!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.47,0:04:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Settle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.51,0:04:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.59,0:05:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Pharaoh, it's family only.\NMakura, what have you done with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.65,0:05:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The same thing I'm about to do with\Nthe stone Get it out of your reach
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.75,0:05:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the items
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.25,0:05:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Pharaoh, but I can't take\Nany more chances now, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.75,0:05:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Not with Zork's arrival so near.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.93,0:05:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.61,0:05:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now our shadow game is at a standstill,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.43,0:05:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,so we sit and wait for Zork\Nto arrive so I can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.49,0:05:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the meantime, I've decided to\Nhave a little fun with your game pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.97,0:05:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to me that your Guardians\Ncould use some time apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.29,0:05:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you planning to do with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.03,0:05:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy them, one at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.85,0:06:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.11,0:06:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to play a little\Ngame of hide and seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.85,0:06:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I just had the weirdest dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.35,0:06:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.77,0:06:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, maybe that wasn't a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.17,0:06:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.45,0:06:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This place looks familiar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.71,0:07:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Great. So basically,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.49,0:07:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I got knocked unconscious\Nand woke up in some
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.79,0:07:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,oddball town that hasn't\Nchanged in 5,000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.75,0:07:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't race into the Nile! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.55,0:07:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta head start!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.93,0:07:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.45,0:07:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not even running my fastest!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.33,0:07:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.93,0:07:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Those kids passed right through me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.59,0:07:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as if I don't exist here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.37,0:07:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.03,0:07:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.53,0:07:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.21,0:07:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you look like him. Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.13,0:07:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you. You're that\Ngirl I saw in my vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.83,0:07:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Kisara.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.95,0:07:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.55,0:08:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And why are you dressed\Nin those strange clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.19,0:08:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I have some questions\Nfor you Like, where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.65,0:08:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And why are you the\Nonly one who can see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,An evil force is threatening\Nour land We must act quickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.17,0:08:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,or everything will be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.85,0:08:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You expect me to believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.77,0:08:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You can believe what you wish, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.89,0:08:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But the darkness is coming,\Nand I've got to warn Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.09,0:08:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking for your friends? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.89,0:08:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you've done with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.59,0:08:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought some time. Have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.55,0:08:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll clear the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.75,0:08:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Mahad! Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.95,0:08:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.65,0:08:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Shimon, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.47,0:08:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, but where do you suppose we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.47,0:08:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Akura!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.38,0:08:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cheating! Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.59,0:08:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I make the rules in this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.51,0:08:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is the part where\Nwe wait for the Great
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.67,0:09:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Zop to resurrect and\Nwatch your friends squirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.69,0:09:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So enjoy the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.93,0:09:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you win. I'm\Nafraid I already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.19,0:09:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,how'd i get out here so weird
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.53,0:09:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,i wonder where everyone else is
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.67,0:09:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,i smell trouble now i hear trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.63,0:09:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,According to Bobasa, the pharaoh's\Nreal name is hidden somewhere in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.37,0:09:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then, let's head in, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.89,0:09:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I say, ladies first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.87,0:09:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so now you decide to be a gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.31,0:09:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise we won't let you down, pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.85,0:09:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So, uh, did anyone bring a flashlight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.07,0:09:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahat, any sign of the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.49,0:09:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately not, my king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.63,0:10:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.54,0:10:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure separating us is all part\Nof Bakura's plan to stall for time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.87,0:10:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I have a feeling he's\Ndoing more than just waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.43,0:10:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If I know Bakura, he's planning\Nto weaken our defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.67,0:10:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So when Zork arrives,\Nhe'll be unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.15,0:10:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.11,0:10:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I do. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.21,0:10:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Egypt's most devastating predator.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.37,0:10:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.01,0:10:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.92,0:10:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.31,0:10:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I asked!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.53,0:10:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.19,0:10:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Kareem, thank goodness you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.57,0:10:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But how is the pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.19,0:10:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You must make sure he is all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.79,0:10:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not going to leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.69,0:10:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Isis, I barely have enough\Nenergy to summon a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.05,0:11:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm of no use to you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.65,0:11:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Kareem...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.63,0:11:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, it is your duty\Nto protect our king.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.51,0:11:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.17,0:11:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I starting to bug you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.15,0:11:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Magical Orb, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.05,0:11:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There are thousands of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.93,0:11:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.95,0:11:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,One by one, your precious gate\Npieces are being crushed, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.43,0:11:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.27,0:11:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,As Pakora's hourglass counts\Ndown to the destruction of Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My guardians grow weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.91,0:11:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Before long, he'll have\Nsucceeded in rewriting history.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.79,0:12:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.13,0:12:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If only you could remember a\Nlittle more about your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.79,0:12:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you might know how\Nyou beat me the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.91,0:12:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But no, you had to go and\Nerase your own memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.29,0:12:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,giving me the chance to do what\NI should have done ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.35,0:12:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.99,0:12:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mana, it looks like your\Nfriend could use some
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.97,0:12:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,help too bad there's\Nno one around for miles
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.93,0:12:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,think you're so tough well check this out
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.51,0:12:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,well done as if that's\Ngoing to help please she's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.87,0:12:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,just wasting her time and\Nmy time just take a Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.35,0:12:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,your pathetic guardians\Nare even more pathetic
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.85,0:12:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,now that I've isolated\Nthem from one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.65,0:13:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The only question is, who will lose\Ntheir soul to the shadows first?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.11,0:13:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Any guesses?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.55,0:13:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.91,0:13:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You should try and have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.95,0:13:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Two-headed jackal warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.61,0:13:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.61,0:13:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Shaddaa. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.25,0:13:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But I fear you and I are not\Nthe only ones under attack. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.51,0:13:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us find the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.71,0:13:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.62,0:13:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.91,0:13:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Those pawns of yours\Ndon't know when to quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.75,0:13:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They're friends, not pawns. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.81,0:13:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How very insensitive of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.77,0:13:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot how much you care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.55,0:13:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.89,0:13:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't remember the first\Nthing about these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.77,0:13:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet somehow, you feel compelled to call\Nthese virtual strangers your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.17,0:13:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My advice is let them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.55,0:14:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.49,0:14:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never had a friend in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.03,0:14:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not remember them, but there is a\Nbond between us that's lasted 5,000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.23,0:14:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A bond that can never be broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.05,0:14:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.51,0:14:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No, please, Isis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.11,0:14:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Two-headed jackal warrior.\NAre you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.69,0:14:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Isis! It's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.23,0:14:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You arrived just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.51,0:14:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Kareem?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.77,0:14:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You three are here, then who\Nis protecting the Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.21,0:14:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we shall find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.07,0:15:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Shaddaa, please take\Nwhat is left of my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.41,0:15:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.67,0:15:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, before I enter the Shadow Realm,\NI want the Pharaoh to have my strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.39,0:15:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.55,0:15:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.09,0:15:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Kareem, your strength\Nmay have saved our king.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.21,0:15:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This ends now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.71,0:15:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Jackal Warrior, time to finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.99,0:15:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadda!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.41,0:15:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.73,0:16:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.59,0:16:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My king, I know you'll defeat Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.51,0:16:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And the darkness over\NEgypt will be no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.63,0:16:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and you'll return.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.35,0:16:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Until then, I wish you\Nall the best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.31,0:16:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.39,0:16:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.85,0:16:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kareem...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.61,0:16:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.99,0:16:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.93,0:16:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to put an end to this madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.27,0:16:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hassan, stay here and protect the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.05,0:16:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to find Settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.99,0:16:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't allow another friend to\Nfall victim to the shadows, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.97,0:16:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If that is your wish,\Nthen I shall obey my king.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.81,0:16:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That is my wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.75,0:16:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.39,0:17:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.21,0:17:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.12,0:17:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.33,0:17:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I mention that this place is loaded\Nwith traps to keep out intruders?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.31,0:17:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You could have told me sooner!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.59,0:17:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he happen to mention how we're\Nsupposed to get through this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.33,0:17:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.24,0:17:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope I can remember everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.31,0:17:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.29,0:17:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So what did your gramps\Nsay about this maze?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.61,0:17:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see those statues?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.55,0:17:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They're kind of like robots. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.45,0:17:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ancient Egyptian robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.31,0:17:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.57,0:17:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He also said that whoever enters\Nneeds to show their respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.53,0:17:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,just like the ancient Egyptians did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.71,0:17:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at how these\Nstatues are standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.15,0:18:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,See how their left feet are forward?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.63,0:18:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.77,0:18:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,In the old days, pointing your foot\Ntowards the Pharaoh was a sign of respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.05,0:18:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.33,0:18:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we should move with our\Nleft foot forward. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.09,0:18:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just walk like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.25,0:18:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be the final test.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.93,0:18:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.13,0:18:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If I remember the story right,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.29,0:18:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,each one of these stone tablets\Nhas a monster living inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.87,0:18:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And if they sense fear, they'll attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.53,0:18:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Grandpa mention a shortcut?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.77,0:18:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and preferably one without monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.99,0:18:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ringing any bells, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.03,0:18:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi! Careful! Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.05,0:18:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll only attack if they sense fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.53,0:18:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And with the fate of the\Nwhole world depending on us,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.15,0:18:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.09,0:18:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what I mean, right? No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.65,0:18:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But as always, we're right\Nbehind you, Yug. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.59,0:19:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be where Grandpa\Nfound the Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.65,0:19:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, there's nothing here, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.09,0:19:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe that writing carved\Non the wall has some clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.89,0:19:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.71,0:19:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This Egyptian is all Greek to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.47,0:19:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.13,0:19:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.77,0:19:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe there's another room\Nthat even Gramps couldn't find.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.21,0:19:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but good luck finding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.55,0:19:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.45,0:19:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.77,0:19:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.31,0:19:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad these fools will\Nnever see what's inside.
